           'summary': 'Goldman Sachs Group Inc management is considering '
                      'whether to scale back financial targets set earlier '
                      'this year, as the coronavirus pandemic has hindered the '
                      "bank's business model revamp, analysts and sources "
                      'inside the bank told Reuters. Goldman unveiled plans to '
                      'boost returns on equity and cut costs during its '
                      'first-ever investor day in January. To reach its goals, '
                      'Goldman would squeeze more revenue from existing '
                      'businesses like wealth management as well as relatively '
                      'new ones like consumer lending, while launching '
                      'additional corporate services like cash management.',
           'title': 'Exclusive: Goldman Sachs financial targets jeopardized as '
                    'pandemic slows revamp',
